智能产品设计师

正式
设计
北京

职位描述

1. Create the next generation of AI products integrated with travel scenarios, design product features that are practical and valuable to users, and drive product strategy and technological innovation;

2. Lead the AI product design process, including requirements analysis, conceptual design, interactive prototype, testing iteration, and implementation verification;

3. Build AI product design solutions for autonomous driving, intelligent cockpit, voice interaction, or MultiModal Machine Learning experience;

4. Track global technological trends in the fields of AI and intelligent mobility, and translate cutting-edge research into design opportunities;

5. Promote design standardization and systematization to improve the efficiency and consistency of AI product design;

6. Balance user requests, technical feasibility, and business objectives in design decisions;

7. Lead design reviews and cross-team communication, clearly articulate design logic and value.

职位要求

1. Has work experience in AI technology companies, and is familiar with the product development processes and innovation models of cutting-edge technology enterprises;

2. Has design experience in AI-related products (such as generative AI, autonomous driving, intelligent assistants, voice interaction, etc.), and is able to independently complete the design and delivery of complex AI hardware product functions;

3. Possesses strategic and systematic thinking, capable of driving product innovation and achieving business goals through design;

4. Excellent English communication skills, able to adapt to cross-cultural and cross-time zone teamwork.

申请职位

1、支持大模型token服务平台的产品设计与日常运营，参与功能设计、原型梳理与体验优化，推动需求高效落地;
2、承担平台运营执行工作，包括用量与成本数据的统计核对、运营看板维护,及时发现并跟进数据异常;
3、协助客户支持与场景调研，整理高频需求与反馈，沉淀使用文档与最佳实践;
4、参与产品 SLA 与核心指标的监测，开展国内外大模型 API 产品的体验测试与竞品调研。
1、2027届获得本科及以上学历, 计算机、人工智能、信息管理或相关领域专业
